# --- final generalized-safety release (M1/M2/M3/M3') ---
# Row-level artifacts are never committed: prompts, generations, judgments,
# private maps, call journals, population manifests, hidden states, logs.
# Only aggregate JSON summaries under results/ and source/config/docs are tracked.
*.jsonl
*PRIVATE*
*private_map*
